           "t": "heading",
           "level": "h2",
           "html": "Why Celebrate 710?",
           "text": "Why Celebrate 710?"
          },
          {
           "t": "text",
           "html": "<p>The 710 holiday, celebrated on July 10th (7/10), is a day dedicated to the appreciation and celebration of cannabis concentrates and oils. The date was chosen because when written as “710” and turned upside down, it resembles the word “OIL,” which is a common term for cannabis extracts. This holiday has gained popularity within the cannabis community, similar to how April 20th (4/20) is celebrated for all cannabis products. On 710, enthusiasts often engage in activities such as dabbing, vaping, and sharing information about the benefits and use of cannabis concentrates. The day is marked by events, promotions, and social gatherings focused on this specific form of cannabis consumption.</p>"
          }
